           "text": "# Trading namespace: the orders-api workload, its service, configuration and ingress policy.\n# Applied with: kubectl apply -f sample-workloads.yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: trading\n---\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: orders-api\n  namespace: trading\n  labels: { app: orders-api, tier: backend }\nspec:\n  replicas: 2\n  selector:\n    matchLabels: { app: orders-api }\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels: { app: orders-api, tier: backend }\n    spec:\n      containers:\n        - name: orders-api\n          image: nginx:1.27-alpine\n          ports: [{ containerPort: 80 }]\n          # NB: no resources.requests/limits set — the target gap for the demo change.\n          env:\n            - name: ORDERS_FEED_URL\n              value: \"http://market-data.trading.svc.cluster.local:8080\"\n---\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: orders-api\n  namespace: trading\nspec:\n  selector: { app: orders-api }\n  ports: [{ port: 80, targetPort: 80 }]\n---\napiVersion: v1\nkind: ConfigMap\nmetadata:\n  name: orders-api-config\n  namespace: trading\ndata:\n  LOG_LEVEL: \"info\"\n  FEED_TIMEOUT_MS: \"2500\"\n---\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: orders-api-ingress\n  namespace: trading\nspec:\n  podSelector:\n    matchLabels: { app: orders-api }\n  policyTypes: [Ingress]\n  ingress:\n    - from:\n        - podSelector:\n            matchLabels: { tier: frontend }\n      ports:\n        - { protocol: TCP, port: 80 }\n",
